---
title: "OKC — End-to-End Flow: Author → Upload → Integrate → Serve → Read"
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: "15px"
    actorFontSize: "15px"
    noteFontSize: "13px"
    messageFontSize: "13px"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as 👤 Contributor
    participant MCP as okc-mcp<br/>(stdio MCP)
    participant H as okc-hooks<br/>(vault daemon)
    participant W as okc-web<br/>(FastAPI + SPA)
    participant E as okc-core<br/>(okc-compiler)
    actor CU as 👤 Curator
    actor AI as 🤖 AI client

    rect rgb(232, 244, 255)
    Note over C,H: 1. Author — write notes in a local Obsidian vault
    C->>MCP: authoring tools (create / edit source notes)
    MCP-->>C: note written to local vault
    Note right of C: or edit the vault directly in Obsidian
    end

    rect rgb(232, 255, 240)
    Note over H,W: 2. Upload — okc-hooks watches and pushes revisions (auth token, resumable CBOR)
    H->>H: watch file events + startup / periodic scan
    H->>W: POST /api/sync/negotiate
    W-->>H: missing blob list
    loop each missing blob (resumable)
        H->>W: PUT /api/sync/blob/{hash}/{offset}
    end
    H->>W: POST /api/sync/commit
    W-->>H: source revision stored
    end

    rect rgb(255, 249, 230)
    Note over CU,E: 3. Integrate — permission-gated human-in-the-loop pipeline
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects (create project)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/tokens (issue upload token)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/freeze (freeze source set)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/provider (select LLM provider)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/preflight (gate check)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/integrate
    W-->>CU: 202 JobAccepted (async job)
    W->>E: propose taxonomy + clusters (via provider)
    Note over W,E: provider → disclosure → taxonomy → clusters → critic review
    E-->>W: proposal + independent critic findings
    CU->>W: GET /taxonomy then POST /taxonomy/approve
    CU->>W: GET /clusters then POST /clusters/{cid}/approve (or /regenerate)
    CU->>W: GET /review/gate (all approvals present?)
    CU->>W: POST /api/projects/{id}/compile
    W->>E: CorpusBuilder::build (provider-free, deterministic)
    E-->>W: merged vault + provenance
    end

    rect rgb(244, 238, 255)
    Note over W: 4. Serve — publish a fixed, verifiable revision
    W->>W: publish version-pinned revision (history + restore)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 238, 245)
    Note over AI,W: 5. Read — consume the verified corpus
    AI->>MCP: query published knowledge
    MCP->>W: GET /api/serving/{id}/... (read access)
    W-->>MCP: version-pinned verified corpus
    MCP-->>AI: published OKC knowledge
    Note right of MCP: a web error never silently<br/>falls back to local knowledge
    end
